sequenceDiagram
    participant P0 as Admin / reviewer
    participant P1 as FastAPI
    participant P2 as Case service
    participant P3 as PostgreSQL
    P0->>P1: POST /admin/cases/import: draft blueprint
    P1->>P2: Validate admin + draft
    P2->>P3: Persist version; commit
    P1->>P0: 201: case ID, version, blockers
    P0->>P1: POST /admin/cases/{code}/approve: blueprint + evidence + confirmations
    P1->>P2: Check reviewer allowlist; approve snapshot
    P2->>P3: Persist approved version
    P1->>P0: Approved pending publication
    P0->>P1: POST /admin/cases/{code}/versions/{n}/publish
    P1->>P2: Check publication eligibility
    P2->>P3: Set published version; commit
    P1->>P0: Status + published version
